' Pictures set in Picture are taken to be authored for this DPI. Fixed and not a
' property: a per-control "assume the source is 120 DPI" setting only moves the
' guess around, and the PicNN properties already exist for saying it properly
Private Const cPicScaleSourceDPI As Long = 96
' Inside this much of 1:1 the original is used as it is.
Private Const cPicScaleDeadBand As Single = 0.1

' Floor for the tab height in TDI Forms mode, in pixels at 96 DPI: the smallest
' size TDIFormsIconSize offers plus the same padding the measuring loop adds
Private Const cTDIFormsMinTabHeight As Long = 21

