' the last tab of a row - lays its right border.
Private Const cThemedRightEdgePartInset As Long = 2
Private Const cIconClickExtend As Long = 5 ' extend the click area a bit for catching the click when the user does not click exactly on the icon area but very near
' How far the right edge snap may STRETCH the last tab of a row to meet the frame, in pixels before
' DPI scaling.
Private Const cRowSnapStretchBudget As Long = 3
' What turns a color into its disabled variant: a step on lightness plus a factor on saturation.
Private Const cDisabledStateLightenDelta As Long = 25
Private Const cDisabledStateDarkenDelta As Long = 20
Private Const cDisabledStateBackSaturationFactor As Double = 0.6
' How much of the way toward its own background something drawn over a tab moves when it is
' disabled.
Private Const cDisabledStateForeApproachFactor As Double = 0.45
' The two families do not fade by the same amount, and the reason is what each of them is for.
Private Const cDisabledStateForeSaturationFactor As Double = 0.2
' How far the automatic BackColorSelectedTab of the flat style sits from BackColorTabs on the
' lightness axis, and how little room upward is still worth using.
Private Const cAutomaticSelectedTabLightenDeltaDark As Long = 45
Private Const cAutomaticSelectedTabLightenDeltaLight As Long = 18
