Public Property Get CloseButtonPosition() As NTCloseButtonPositionConstants
Attribute CloseButtonPosition.VB_Description = "Returns/sets where the close button is shown: on each tab, a single one at the end of the tab strip that closes the selected tab, or only on the selected tab, the tab under the mouse, or both. Every tab keeps the room for its button, shown or not."
